    <item>
      <title>Pwn 基础之C/C&#43;&#43;（一）：从第一个 C 程序到数据类型</title>
      <link>https://blog.m15tak3.com/post/01-c-program-types/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 14:00:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
      <author>skyman.soul@gmail.com (M15tak3)</author>
      <guid>https://blog.m15tak3.com/post/01-c-program-types/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>Pwn 基础之C/C++（一）：从第一个 C 程序到数据类型</h1><p>作者：M15tak3（skyman.soul@gmail.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="pwn-基础之cc一从第一个-c-程序到数据类型">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pwn-%e5%9f%ba%e7%a1%80%e4%b9%8bcc%e4%b8%80%e4%bb%8e%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%aa-c-%e7%a8%8b%e5%ba%8f%e5%88%b0%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e7%b1%bb%e5%9e%8b"></a>
Pwn 基础之C/C++（一）：从第一个 C 程序到数据类型
</h1><blockquote>
<p><strong>本篇目标</strong>：能够编译 C 程序，看懂变量声明，并理解整数、字符和字节之间的关系。</p>
<p><strong>系列定位</strong>：面向 C/C++ 零基础读者，为后续学习二进制程序打基础；本文不讲漏洞利用。</p>
<p><strong>预计阅读时间</strong>：15～20 分钟。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="1-第一个-c-程序">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1-%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%aa-c-%e7%a8%8b%e5%ba%8f"></a>
1. 第一个 C 程序
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#include</span> <span class="cpf">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span><span class="cp">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">void</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Hello, world!</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>保存为 <code>hello.c</code>，然后编译、运行：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">gcc hello.c -o hello
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">./hello
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其中：</p>
<ul>
<li><code>#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</code> 引入标准输入输出函数的声明；</li>
<li><code>main</code> 是程序入口；</li>
<li><code>printf</code> 向标准输出打印内容；</li>
<li><code>\n</code> 表示换行；</li>
<li><code>return 0</code> 表示程序正常结束。</li>
</ul>
<p>带命令行参数的入口可以写成：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">argc</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="kt">char</span> <span class="o">*</span><span class="n">argv</span><span class="p">[])</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>argc</code> 是参数数量，<code>argv</code> 保存各参数字符串的地址。</p>
<h2 id="2-变量是什么">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#2-%e5%8f%98%e9%87%8f%e6%98%af%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88"></a>
2. 变量是什么
</h2><p>变量是一块有名称、有类型的存储空间：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">age</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">18</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">char</span> <span class="n">grade</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="sc">&#39;A&#39;</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">double</span> <span class="n">score</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mf">95.5</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>声明的一般形式是：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">类型 变量名 = 初始值;
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>类型决定了编译器如何解释这块数据，以及通常需要读取多少字节。</p>
<h2 id="3-常用数据类型">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#3-%e5%b8%b8%e7%94%a8%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e7%b1%bb%e5%9e%8b"></a>
3. 常用数据类型
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">char</span> <span class="n">c</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="sc">&#39;A&#39;</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">short</span> <span class="n">s</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">1000</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">long</span> <span class="n">l</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">10000</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">long</span> <span class="kt">long</span> <span class="n">ll</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">100000</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">float</span> <span class="n">f</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mf">3.14f</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">double</span> <span class="n">d</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mf">3.1415926</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在常见 Linux x86-64 环境中：</p>
<table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th>类型</th>
          <th style="text-align: right">常见大小</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td><code>char</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: right">1 字节</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>short</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: right">2 字节</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>int</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: right">4 字节</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>long</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: right">8 字节</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>long long</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: right">8 字节</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>float</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: right">4 字节</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>double</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: right">8 字节</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>指针</td>
          <td style="text-align: right">8 字节</td>
      </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>这些大小与平台和 ABI 有关，应该用 <code>sizeof</code> 验证：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#include</span> <span class="cpf">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span><span class="cp">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">void</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;char: %zu</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="k">sizeof</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">char</span><span class="p">));</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;int: %zu</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="k">sizeof</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="p">));</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;long: %zu</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="k">sizeof</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">long</span><span class="p">));</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;pointer: %zu</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="k">sizeof</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">void</span> <span class="o">*</span><span class="p">));</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="4-位字节和十六进制">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#4-%e4%bd%8d%e5%ad%97%e8%8a%82%e5%92%8c%e5%8d%81%e5%85%ad%e8%bf%9b%e5%88%b6"></a>
4. 位、字节和十六进制
</h2><p>现代计算机中通常有：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">1 byte = 8 bit
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个 bit 只能取 <code>0</code> 或 <code>1</code>。一个字节共有 <code>2^8 = 256</code> 种状态。</p>
<p>十六进制很适合表示内存：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">1 个十六进制数字 = 4 bit
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">2 个十六进制数字 = 1 byte
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>C 中的十六进制整数以 <code>0x</code> 开头：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">16</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">b</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mh">0x10</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>a</code> 和 <code>b</code> 的值相同。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;decimal: %d</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;hex: 0x%x</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="5-固定宽度整数">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#5-%e5%9b%ba%e5%ae%9a%e5%ae%bd%e5%ba%a6%e6%95%b4%e6%95%b0"></a>
5. 固定宽度整数
</h2><p>处理二进制数据时，常用 <code>&lt;stdint.h&gt;</code> 中的类型：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#include</span> <span class="cpf">&lt;stdint.h&gt;</span><span class="cp">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">uint8_t</span>  <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">uint16_t</span> <span class="n">b</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">uint32_t</span> <span class="n">c</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">3</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">uint64_t</span> <span class="n">d</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int8_t</span>  <span class="n">e</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int32_t</span> <span class="n">f</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li><code>u</code> 表示无符号；</li>
<li>数字表示位数；</li>
<li><code>_t</code> 表示这是一个类型名。</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="6-有符号无符号与补码">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#6-%e6%9c%89%e7%ac%a6%e5%8f%b7%e6%97%a0%e7%ac%a6%e5%8f%b7%e4%b8%8e%e8%a1%a5%e7%a0%81"></a>
6. 有符号、无符号与补码
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">signed_value</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">unsigned</span> <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">unsigned_value</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>32 位整数的常见范围：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">int32_t：  -2^31 ～ 2^31-1
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">uint32_t： 0 ～ 2^32-1
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>现代计算机通常使用补码表示负数。以 8 位的 <code>-5</code> 为例：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl"> 5       = 00000101
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">按位取反 = 11111010
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">加一     = 11111011
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同一组字节可以被解释成有符号数或无符号数。因此，分析表达式时必须同时关注“值”和“类型”。</p>
<h2 id="7-字符本质上也是整数">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#7-%e5%ad%97%e7%ac%a6%e6%9c%ac%e8%b4%a8%e4%b8%8a%e4%b9%9f%e6%98%af%e6%95%b4%e6%95%b0"></a>
7. 字符本质上也是整数
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">char</span> <span class="n">ch</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="sc">&#39;A&#39;</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;character: %c</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">ch</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;decimal: %d</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">ch</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;hex: 0x%x</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">unsigned</span> <span class="kt">char</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="n">ch</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ASCII 中常见值：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">&#39;A&#39;  = 65 = 0x41
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">&#39;a&#39;  = 97 = 0x61
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">&#39;0&#39;  = 48 = 0x30
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">&#39;\n&#39; = 10 = 0x0a
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="8-基础运算符">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#8-%e5%9f%ba%e7%a1%80%e8%bf%90%e7%ae%97%e7%ac%a6"></a>
8. 基础运算符
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">10</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">b</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">3</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">sum</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">sub</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">mul</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">div</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">/</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">mod</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">%</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>整数除法会舍弃小数部分：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;%d</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">5</span> <span class="o">/</span> <span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">);</span>       <span class="c1">// 2
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;%f</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mf">5.0</span> <span class="o">/</span> <span class="mf">2.0</span><span class="p">);</span>   <span class="c1">// 2.500000
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>比较运算符：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">==  !=  &gt;  &lt;  &gt;=  &lt;=
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>逻辑运算符：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">&amp;&amp;  ||  !
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>位运算符：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">&amp;  |  ^  ~  &lt;&lt;  &gt;&gt;
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>例如判断最低位：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">value</span> <span class="o">&amp;</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nf">printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;odd</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="本篇练习">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%af%87%e7%bb%83%e4%b9%a0"></a>
本篇练习
</h2><ol>
<li>编写程序打印所有基础类型的 <code>sizeof</code>。</li>
<li>输入一个整数，分别以十进制和十六进制输出。</li>
<li>输出字符 <code>A</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>0</code> 的数值。</li>
<li>使用位运算判断一个整数的奇偶性。</li>
<li>分别使用 <code>int32_t</code> 和 <code>uint32_t</code> 保存数据并观察输出。</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="本篇小结">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%af%87%e5%b0%8f%e7%bb%93"></a>
本篇小结
</h2><ul>
<li>C 程序从 <code>main</code> 开始执行；</li>
<li>类型决定数据的大小和解释方式；</li>
<li>内存以字节为基本观察单位；</li>
<li>十六进制便于表示地址和原始字节；</li>
<li>字符也是整数；</li>
<li>阅读整数表达式时必须关注位宽和符号属性。</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="下一篇">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e4%b8%8b%e4%b8%80%e7%af%87"></a>
下一篇
</h2><p>下一篇学习条件、循环、函数、作用域和按值传递，让程序真正具备处理逻辑。</p>

        
